  "scope": "For L_n as frozen verbatim in source.md and interpreted in problem.md, there are no d>0 and 42-element V contained in {2,...,529-d} for which the 84 integers v and v+d are all distinct and pairwise coprime. Consequently no such witness exists for any x<=529, so L_42>=530 and the original equality L_42=529 is false.",
